    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8hcbbf6",
      "content": "Uttarakhand is a northern Indian state located in the Western Himalayas. It lies between 28°43'N to 31°27'N latitude and 77°34'E to 81°02'E longitude. The state covers an area of 53,483 sq. km (1.63% of India's area). It is the 18th largest state by area."
    },
